</script></span> </div>
                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">当前，新冠肺炎疫情防控的国际形势严峻复杂，国内本土疫情呈零星散发和局部聚集性疫情交织叠加态势。为切实应对疫情，做好疫情防控常态化管理，根据国务院疫情联防联控机制综合组和省、市疫情防控部门最新通知精神，现对我校今冬明春疫情防控工作提出如下要求：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '微软雅黑','sans-serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 微软雅黑">进校篇</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">所有教职员工和学生入校前，在家做好体温监测，体温超过</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>37.3</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">℃（含）不得入校并及时就医，当天将检查结果反馈给学校。进入校园时必须戴好口罩，并自觉接受体温检测。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">所有非本校人员和车辆无必须不得进校，在获得许可后人员和车辆进校均需接受检查。出示浙江健康码，检测体温并登记相关信息。体温超过</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>37.3</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">℃（含）或健康码非绿码不得入校，在校期间全程佩戴口罩。所有来自中、高风险地区的快递禁止进入校园。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '微软雅黑','sans-serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 微软雅黑">学生篇<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">全面做好个人防护。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">自觉养成卫生习惯、健康生活习惯，加强体育锻炼，科学佩戴口罩，用“七步洗手法”洗手。乘坐公共交通工具时要全程佩戴口罩。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">加强自我健康管理。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在校期间，身体如有异常，立即报告班主任并前往医院就医。住校生每次进入宿舍自觉接受体温检查。食堂就餐注意餐饮礼仪。学生在校期间不串座、不串班、不打闹，保持安全社交距离。班级要落实专人负责要做好教室的通风换气工作。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '微软雅黑','sans-serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 微软雅黑">教职工篇</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">全面做好个人防护。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">自觉养成卫生习惯、健康生活习惯，加强体育锻炼，科学佩戴口罩，勤洗手，室内经常开窗通风消毒。尽量不去、少去密闭空间和人员密集场所。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">严格出行管理。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">非必要不外出，原则上不出绍兴市，不得前往中、高风险地区及其所在的设区市，更不得赴境外旅游探亲。如确需出行，必须实行外出报备制度，经学校同意后方可出行，坚决不允许出现未报备私自外出现象。学校建立教职工出行台账，明确记录离绍和返绍时间、出行方式、行程经过。外出后，回绍返校前</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>14</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">天要做好每天的体温检测和记录，并在返校时提交。对来自中高风险地区所在设区市返校的教职员工还需查验</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>7</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">天内核酸检测阴性证明，有中、高风险地区旅居史教职员工暂不返校。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">认真履行防疫义务。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">出行时注意保持</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">米以上的社交距离。乘坐公共交通工具、电梯或出入商场、超市、宾馆、饭店、农贸市场等密闭空间和场所要全程佩戴口罩，主动配合防控人员做好防控工作。发现从中、高风险地区回绍人员，必须第一时间上报社区或学校。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">严格控制聚集活动。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">不邀约中、高风险地区所在设区市来绍人员聚会聚餐，有流感等症状尽量不参加，家庭聚会尽量控制在</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>10</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">人以下，尽可能减少不必要的聚集性活动。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: '微软雅黑','sans-serif'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 20.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 微软雅黑">家长篇</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">做好孩子入校前准备工作。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">根据疫情防控要求，学生入校时要戴好口罩。在孩子入校前，家长要对孩子进行体温监测。体温异常时不得入校。配合学校做好上、下学管理。接送时，车辆即停即走，避免在学校门口聚集。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">如实上报孩子健康信息。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">孩子不能到校上课，家长需向班主任请假，并具体讲清楚请假事由。如出现发烧、干咳、腹泻等异常情况，或与中、高风险地区人员有接触史，家长必须带孩子及时就医，并在第一时间上报班主任。绝不允许吃退热药后来校上学。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">按规做好体温异常情况应对。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">如学生体温超过</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>37.3</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">℃（含），不得入校，要及时就医，并将检查结果反馈给班主任。体温异常学生接受新冠血清抗体和核酸检测，且检测结果均为阴性，待体温正常、呼吸道症状消失后方可申请复课（发热患者需症状消失</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>48</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">小时后方可申请返校，呕吐腹泻患者需症状消失</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>72</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">小时方可申请返校）。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">严格出行管理。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">根据防疫要求，非必要不外出，原则上不出本市，更不得前往中、高风险地区及其所在的设区市，严禁境外旅游度假。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">严格控制聚集活动。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">建议近期不举办、不参加大型聚餐活动，家庭私人聚会控制在</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>10</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">人以下。尽量不要带孩子出入人员聚集及密闭的空间。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">认真履行防疫义务。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">不得隐瞒与中、高风险地区人员的接触史，发现从中、高风险地区回绍人员，必须第一时间上报社区，并告知学校。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>                         </FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">绍兴市第一中学疫情防控工作专班</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                               </SPAN>2021</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">年</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">月</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>15</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">日</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 18.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P> </P>
    
